{"audio_filepath": "wavs/hi_01.wav", "text": "नमस्ते, आप कैसे हैं?", "language": "hi", "speaker": "hi_f1"}
{"audio_filepath": "wavs/hi_02.wav", "text": "मेरा नाम अनीता है।", "language": "hi", "speaker": "hi_f1"}
{"audio_filepath": "wavs/hi_03.wav", "text": "आज मौसम बहुत अच्छा है।", "language": "hi", "speaker": "hi_f1"}
{"audio_filepath": "wavs/hi_04.wav", "text": "वह रोज़ सुबह दौड़ने जाता है।", "language": "hi", "speaker": "hi_f1"}
{"audio_filepath": "wavs/hi_05.wav", "text": "बच्चे बगीचे में खेल रहे हैं।", "language": "hi", "speaker": "hi_f1"}
{"audio_filepath": "wavs/hi_06.wav", "text": "कृपया दरवाज़ा बंद कर दीजिए।", "language": "hi", "speaker": "hi_f1"}
{"audio_filepath": "wavs/hi_07.wav", "text": "यह किताब मुझे बहुत पसंद आई।", "language": "hi", "speaker": "hi_f1"}
{"audio_filepath": "wavs/hi_08.wav", "text": "गाड़ी स्टेशन पर ठीक समय पर पहुँची।", "language": "hi", "speaker": "hi_f1"}
{"audio_filepath": "wavs/hi_09.wav", "text": "झरने का ठंडा पानी पीकर थकान मिट गई।", "language": "hi", "speaker": "hi_f1"}
{"audio_filepath": "wavs/hi_10.wav", "text": "दुकान से 2 किलो चावल और घी ले आना।", "language": "hi", "speaker": "hi_f1"}
{"audio_filepath": "wavs/bho_01.wav", "text": "रउआ कइसन बानी?", "language": "bho", "speaker": "bho_f1"}
{"audio_filepath": "wavs/bho_02.wav", "text": "हमार नाम सुनीता ह।", "language": "bho", "speaker": "bho_f1"}
{"audio_filepath": "wavs/bho_03.wav", "text": "आज बहुत गरमी बा।", "language": "bho", "speaker": "bho_f1"}
{"audio_filepath": "wavs/bho_04.wav", "text": "हम बजार जात बानी।", "language": "bho", "speaker": "bho_f1"}
{"audio_filepath": "wavs/bho_05.wav", "text": "तोहार घर कहाँ बा?", "language": "bho", "speaker": "bho_f1"}
{"audio_filepath": "wavs/bho_06.wav", "text": "लइका लोग खेलत बाड़न।", "language": "bho", "speaker": "bho_f1"}
{"audio_filepath": "wavs/bho_07.wav", "text": "माई खाना बनावत बाड़ी।", "language": "bho", "speaker": "bho_f1"}
{"audio_filepath": "wavs/bho_08.wav", "text": "काल्ह हमनी के गाँव जाइब।", "language": "bho", "speaker": "bho_f1"}
{"audio_filepath": "wavs/bho_09.wav", "text": "ई किताब बहुत नीमन बा।", "language": "bho", "speaker": "bho_f1"}
{"audio_filepath": "wavs/bho_10.wav", "text": "पानी पी ल, फेर चलल जाई।", "language": "bho", "speaker": "bho_f1"}
